      "zh": "交易心理与纪律"
    },
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "learningObjectives": {
      "en": [
        "Explain the core decision rules behind separating evidence-based confidence from overconfidence.",
        "Apply separating evidence-based confidence from overconfidence to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释区分证据驱动的信心与过度自信背后的核心决策规则。",
        "将区分证据驱动的信心与过度自信应用于图表证据，同时不承诺交易结果。",
        "在展示技能前记录失效条件与风险控制。"
      ]
    },
